# Simulation build artifacts and transient outputs.
#
# cocotb/Icarus regenerate all of these on every `make`: sim_build/ holds
# the compiled sim.vvp and the command file, results.xml is cocotb's
# per-run JUnit output, and tr_db.log is uvm-python's transaction
# recorder. None of them are reproducible across machines or reviewable
# in a diff, and sim.vvp is a binary.
#
# The sim output logs that ARE committed (examples/*/*_sim_output_*.txt)
# are deliberate, dated evidence that a suite ran and what it printed --
# they are not build artifacts and are not matched here.
sim_build/
results.xml
tr_db.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
